      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Official notification has been received, by way of the Office of the Commissioner of Investigation, that on November 23, 1971, MR. JOSEPH YOUNG of 149-47 22nd Avenue, Whitestone, New York, refused to sign a waiver of immunity when called to testify before a grand jury in connection with the District Attorney's investigation of the Municipal Loan Program.",
